        "desc": "The central campus of the Bangladesh Agricultural Research Institute (BARI) in Joydebpur represents one of the greenest, most scientifically organized botanical campuses in the country. Spanning vast experimental fields, manicured floral gardens, hybrid fruit orchards, and shade-canopied avenues, BARI is the epicenter of agricultural innovation in Bangladesh. Visitors can admire sprawling collections of exotic plant varieties, ornamental palms, experimental greenhouse complexes, and specialized horticultural plots. The campus provides a peaceful, pollution-free atmosphere with expansive manicured lawns where families and researchers walk among centuries-old shade trees. It offers an inspiring look into the scientific achievements that underpin the nation's food security alongside superb botanical beauty.",
        "descEn": "The central campus of the Bangladesh Agricultural Research Institute (BARI) in Joydebpur represents one of the greenest, most scientifically organized botanical campuses in the country. Spanning vast experimental fields, manicured floral gardens, hybrid fruit orchards, and shade-canopied avenues, BARI is the epicenter of agricultural innovation in Bangladesh. Visitors can admire sprawling collections of exotic plant varieties, ornamental palms, experimental greenhouse complexes, and specialized horticultural plots. The campus provides a peaceful, pollution-free atmosphere with expansive manicured lawns where families and researchers walk among centuries-old shade trees. It offers an inspiring look into the scientific achievements that underpin the nation's food security alongside superb botanical beauty.",
