        "desc": "The Tungipara Mausoleum Gardens encompass the beautifully landscaped surrounding grounds of the Bangabandhu Memorial Complex, planned with meticulous ecological care. The gardens feature velvet-like green lawns, ornamental flower beds with seasonal blossoms, weeping willows, and serene lotus ponds traversed by paved walkways. Visitors enjoy tranquil walks along wide tree-lined boulevards where birds sing amid tranquil surroundings. The gardens provide a soothing, reverent setting that complements the emotional gravity of the mausoleum while offering green open spaces for quiet reflection. It is considered one of the finest maintained public landscaped gardens in Bangladesh.",
