        "mapUrl": "https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Mithamain%E2%80%93Austagram+road+and+haor+views%2C+Mithamain+and+Austagram%2C+Upazilas%2C+Kishoreganj%2C+Kishoreganj%2C+Bangladesh"
