        "mapUrl": "https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Noboganga+and+surrounding+countryside%2C+Rural+Manikganj+Sadar+and%2C+Singair+areas%2C+Manikganj%2C+Manikganj%2C+Bangladesh"
