        "desc": "Developed by the Narayanganj District Administration to provide high-quality urban open space, the DC Theme Park features landscaped family grounds and leisure attractions. The park provides green walkways, vibrant floral gardens, children's amusement rides, and shaded recreational kiosks designed for all age groups. It serves as an essential recreational outlet for urban families seeking a safe, clean, and refreshing outdoor environment within easy reach of the city center. Visitors frequently praise the peaceful ambiance, evening decorative illumination, and child-friendly play zones. It exemplifies contemporary efforts to enhance public leisure infrastructure across the riverine district.",
