        "desc": "Dream Holiday Park, situated along the Dhaka-Sylhet highway at Chaitaba near Madhabdi, is one of Bangladesh's premier family theme parks and recreational resorts. Sprawled over 60 acres of beautifully landscaped grounds, it features thrilling amusement rides including a high-speed roller coaster, pirate ship, cable cars, and sky trains. The park's signature water world offers an expansive artificial wave pool where visitors can enjoy simulated ocean surf alongside twisting water slides and lazy river currents. Lush floral gardens, life-sized animal replicas, a tranquil boating lake, and multi-cuisine restaurants provide comprehensive entertainment for visitors of all age groups. It serves as an immensely popular day-trip destination for families and student excursions seeking clean, thrilling outdoor leisure.",
