        "desc": "The Gabkhan Channel is a spectacular river tourism landmark where modern mega-infrastructure meets scenic deltaic waterways. Spanning high over the canal is the monumental Gabkhan Bridge (Fifth Bangladesh-China Friendship Bridge), which rises steeply to allow massive seafaring cargo vessels to pass unimpeded below. Standing atop the bridge or taking an open-top boat ride along the canal below reveals breathtaking aerial panoramas of winding emerald water bordered by palm plantations and village homesteads. Tourists love watching foreign cargo ships and large oil tankers maneuver through the narrow canal turns while refreshing river breezes cool the air. It is an exhilarating destination that showcases the vibrant maritime vitality of southern Bangladesh.",
