        "desc": "Taltala Park in the center of Chuadanga municipality is the premier civic green recreational park and leisure haven for town residents and visiting tourists. Centered around a picturesque freshwater lake, the park features paved jogging boulevards, colorful seasonal flower beds, shaded gazebos, and illuminated night fountains. Children enjoy well-equipped playground equipment and pedal-boat rides across the calm waters, while families stroll along the lake under mature canopy trees. Street vendors outside the gates sell authentic local delicacies, including hot jilapis, roasted peanuts, and regional snacks. It provides a welcoming, family-friendly urban leisure oasis right within the city.",
