        "name": "Chehelgazi Mosque and Shrine",
        "nameEn": "Chehelgazi Mosque and Shrine",
        "nameBn": "চেহেলগাজী মাজার ও ঐতিহাসিক মসজিদ",
        "category": "Medieval Sufi Warriors Sanctuary",
