        "desc": "Gajni Leisure Center (Gajni Obakash Kendra) in Jhenaigati is an iconic nature and amusement park nestled right amidst the scenic slopes of the Garo Hills. Perched on rolling terrain surrounded by natural springs and crystal mountain lakes, the park features a dramatic multi-story observation tower, a thrilling hill cave tunnel, pedal boating facilities, and colorful children's play parks. The summit provides unmatched panoramic views of the green forests of Bangladesh extending seamlessly into the blue mountainous terrain of India. Indigenous Garo and Koch cultural crafts, bamboo handicrafts, and fresh hill pineapples are sold in lively local stalls near the entrance. It is the most celebrated holiday attraction in Sherpur district.",
